WEBVTT - typo3-records-list-types (narration, English)

1
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:07.434
The Records module shows a plain table, even for news with photos.

2
00:00:12.134 --> 00:00:16.509
You ask for cards with thumbnails instead of the table.

3
00:00:18.584 --> 00:00:25.336
The extension adds the views. TSconfig decides which ones each page allows.

4
00:00:26.386 --> 00:00:32.720
Grid, timeline, catalogue: editors switch views, and nothing in core is patched.

5
00:00:34.186 --> 00:00:39.815
Configure, do not patch. Accessibility is evidenced, not assumed.

6
00:00:41.415 --> 00:00:44.641
Open source. Clone the skills.
